{"id":"45ca9c4551913b6a","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion.md","title":"相对 Friedberg 完全性准则","display":"thm-relative-friedberg-inversion — 相对 Friedberg 完全性准则","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion","aliases":["20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion"],"display":"thm-relative-friedberg-inversion — 相对 Friedberg 完全性准则","chapter":"6","section":"6.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 6.4.4；Lemmas 6.4.2–6.4.3","source_printed_pages":[140],"source_pdf_pages":[174],"depends_on":["[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-df-degle]]","[[20-df-jump-forcing]]","[[20-thm-jump]]","[[20-thm-deg-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-friedberg-inversion — 相对 Friedberg 完全性准则"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.4.4；Lemmas 6.4.2–6.4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>140</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>174</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60962a9176d0987e\" href=\"?note=60962a9176d0987e\" title=\"20-df-jump-forcing\">20-df-jump-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cc0aeae8dce11855\" href=\"?note=cc0aeae8dce11855\" title=\"20-thm-deg-join\">20-thm-deg-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf c&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf c&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"60962a9176d0987e\" href=\"?note=60962a9176d0987e\" title=\"20-df-jump-forcing\">20-df-jump-forcing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"cc0aeae8dce11855\" href=\"?note=cc0aeae8dce11855\" title=\"20-thm-deg-join\">20-thm-deg-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}inversion}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ge\\mathbf c\\ [\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c&#39;=\\mathbf b].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}inversion}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ge\\mathbf c\\ [\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c&#39;=\\mathbf b].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf c\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf c\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathbf b\">\\(B\\in\\mathbf b\\)</span>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\\le_TB\">\\(C&#39;\\le_TB\\)</span> 的归约，以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的增长前缀。第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个构造块先用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\">\\(C&#39;\\)</span> 判定是否存在前缀延伸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^{C\\oplus\\rho}(e)\">\\(\\Phi_e^{C\\oplus\\rho}(e)\\)</span> 停止；这是相对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的 c.e. 存在问题。有则取第一个见证并延伸，无则保留当前前缀，永久决定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\notin(C\\oplus X)&#39;\">\\(e\\notin(C\\oplus X)&#39;\\)</span>。然后在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的下一个位置写入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_B(e)\">\\(\\chi_B(e)\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=C\\oplus X\">\\(A=C\\oplus X\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>整个构造由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 计算，每个跳跃位的正负分支也由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 判定，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\le_TB\">\\(A&#39;\\le_TB\\)</span>。反之，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\oplus C&#39;\">\\(A\\oplus C&#39;\\)</span> 可重建每个构造块：先用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\">\\(C&#39;\\)</span> 重建确定性的 forcing 步骤，再读 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的下一位恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(e)\">\\(B(e)\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_TA\\oplus C&#39;\">\\(B\\le_TA\\oplus C&#39;\\)</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\le_TA\">\\(C\\le_TA\\)</span>，单调性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\oplus C&#39;\\le_TA&#39;\">\\(A\\oplus C&#39;\\le_TA&#39;\\)</span>；三者相等，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_T(A)\\ge\\mathbf c\">\\(\\deg_T(A)\\ge\\mathbf c\\)</span>。有限 oracle 记号只截断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 一侧，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 仍是固定完整 oracle。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.4.4；Lemmas 6.4.2–6.4.3；印刷页 140；PDF 第 174 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"60962a9176d0987e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jump]]","embed":f